# Line endings are pinned rather than left to each machine's git configuration.
# This repository was written on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which converts
# on checkout and again on commit; a file that had already been given CRLF once
# came back as CRCRLF, which every reader except pandas saw as blank rows between
# every line. Declaring the intent here means the working copy is LF everywhere,
# on every machine, and no conversion happens at all.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The reference catalogues are compared byte for byte by the test suite.
*.csv text eol=lf
